NODE id=matrix/codegraph/enrich.setSummary kind=func
  digest=b3:06b2e4b1abaec9459d1bf66ffe06e439d059a6a362a985c57224992648240350 file=codegraph/enrich/enrich.go range=94:100 lang=go exported=false byte_range=3547:3895
  sig=func setSummary(n *model.Node, summary, digest string)
  doc=setSummary writes a generated summary and stamps it with the digest it was\nderived from — the ONLY mutation path for summary fields. It touches nothing\nstructural, upholding the quarantine invariant (Requirement 8.1).
